{"version":1,"content":"<p>繼《黑神話：悟空》爆紅後，內地第二款國產3A武俠動作遊戲《影之刃零》今天（29日）全球發售，隨即衝上PC遊戲平台Steam熱銷榜首，首日同時在線人數峰值已突破43萬。</p><p>海外權威評分網站Metacritic顯示，該遊戲暫獲88分，成績超越《黑神話：悟空》的81分。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.066788+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:17:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:13.490827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.616392+00:00","content_hash":"6a0c2a3e5929a519a3e9650245ef4b995aaeaeb818355c1d1a1a7e0a4538f4a4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}